---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import Card from "astro-theme-anu/components/Card.astro";
import CardGrid from "astro-theme-anu/components/CardGrid.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Home">
  <h1>Art and Interaction Computing</h1>
  <h2>COMP1720/6720</h2>

  <p>
    Welcome to COMP1720/6720 Art and Interaction Computing. In this course
    you'll learn to create expressive and interactive art with code. It's not
    <em>just</em> an art course, and it's not <em>just</em> a code course:
    you'll have to do both, and you'll have a lot of fun along the way.
    <strong>No previous coding or artistic experience is required</strong>: the
    COMP1720 team will teach you everything from the ground up.
  </p>

  <p>
    This site contains all the course content: the lab content, assessments, and
    other resources.
  </p>

  <CardGrid columns={3}>
    <Card title="Labs" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}labs/`}>
      <p>Weekly hands-on exercises exploring art and code.</p>
    </Card>
    <Card title="Assessments" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}assessments/`}>
      <p>Assignments and project information.</p>
    </Card>
    <Card title="Resources" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}resources/`}>
      <p>FAQ, software setup, and reference materials.</p>
    </Card>
  </CardGrid>
</SiteLayout>
